  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "Complex numbers as points",
    "kn": "ಸಂಕೀರ್ಣ ಸಂಖ್ಯೆಗಳು ಬಿಂದುಗಳಾಗಿ"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "Every complex number a + ib is a point (a, b) on a plane. Its distance from the origin is its modulus.",
    "kn": "ಪ್ರತಿ ಸಂಕೀರ್ಣ ಸಂಖ್ಯೆ a + ib ಸಮತಲದ ಮೇಲಿನ ಬಿಂದು (a, b). ಮೂಲಬಿಂದುವಿನಿಂದ ಅದರ ದೂರವೇ ಮಾಪಾಂಕ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Plot z on the Argand plane"
    },
    {
     "en": "Find the argument"
    },
    {
     "en": "Write z in polar form"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Every complex number a + ib is a point (a, b) on a plane. Its distance from the origin is its modulus.",
    "kn": "ಪ್ರತಿ ಸಂಕೀರ್ಣ ಸಂಖ್ಯೆ a + ib ಸಮತಲದ ಮೇಲಿನ ಬಿಂದು (a, b). ಮೂಲಬಿಂದುವಿನಿಂದ ಅದರ ದೂರವೇ ಮಾಪಾಂಕ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "The Argand plane"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Plot $z = x + iy$ as the point $P(x, y)$. The x-axis is the real axis and the y-axis the imaginary axis. $|z| = OP$, the distance from the origin. $\\bar{z} = x - iy$ is the mirror image of $z$ in the real axis.",
    "kn": "ಆರ್ಗಂಡ್ ಸಮತಲದಲ್ಲಿ z = x + iy ಬಿಂದು (x, y). x-ಅಕ್ಷ ವಾಸ್ತವ ಅಕ್ಷ, y-ಅಕ್ಷ ಕಾಲ್ಪನಿಕ ಅಕ್ಷ. z̄ ವಾಸ್ತವ ಅಕ್ಷದಲ್ಲಿ z ನ ಪ್ರತಿಬಿಂಬ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "|z| = OP"
    },
    {
     "en": "z̄: reflection in the real axis"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "On the Argand plane the real part is the x-coordinate and the imaginary part is the y-coordinate. The modulus is the distance from the origin, and the conjugate is the reflection in the real axis.",
    "kn": "ಆರ್ಗಂಡ್ ಸಮತಲದಲ್ಲಿ z = x + iy ಬಿಂದು (x, y). x-ಅಕ್ಷ ವಾಸ್ತವ ಅಕ್ಷ, y-ಅಕ್ಷ ಕಾಲ್ಪನಿಕ ಅಕ್ಷ. z̄ ವಾಸ್ತವ ಅಕ್ಷದಲ್ಲಿ z ನ ಪ್ರತಿಬಿಂಬ."
   }
  },
